  "description": "Slip into the paws of a cheeky little cat and turn a cosy seaside town upside down. In Pawbay, every alleyway, rooftop, shop, and hidden nook is packed with playful ways to stir up trouble. Sneak, climb, swipe, and pounce your way through a charming world where curiosity always leads to chaos.\nBetter yet, enjoy the full adventure solo or with a mate in local 2-player split-screen co-op. The town might be lovely, but that won’t stop you from becoming its most unforgettable little menace.\nWith plenty of freedom to experiment, every prank turns into its own funny story.\n\nFeatures:\n• Play as a nimble, curious cat with a knack for causing mischief\n• Enjoy the full game solo or with a mate in local 2-player split-screen co-op\n• Explore a lively town with streets, rooftops, and interiors, uncovering secret paths and hard-to-reach spots\n• Complete playful objectives by stealing, sabotaging, distracting, and more\n• Stir up hilarious reactions from the locals of Pawbay",
